# Interest declared wrongly: a coordinate the position does not have.
program movers.kest

component 0d3f8a3e-7c55-4b8e-9d0e-2a61f3c4b5a1 movers.position Position
component 5b1c9e22-4f07-4d3a-8c6b-91e7d2a0f4c8 movers.velocity Velocity

system movers.integrate simulation integrate write movers.position read movers.velocity

replicate movers.position
interest movers.position x z within 10
